{"4146860": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Azureo Light", "steam_appid": 4146860, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Azureo Light</strong> is an action-adventure RPG. Wield the Cerulean Sword, face shadowy creatures, and uncover the secrets of a world on the brink of collapse.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A world in ruins, a dormant power, and a destiny waiting to be fulfilled.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Azureo Light</strong>, you play as <strong>Erian</strong>, the grandson of a master blacksmith and a resident of a peaceful village. When monsters suddenly appear and attack, your grandfather entrusts you with the legendary <strong>Cerulean Sword</strong> — a rare and powerful weapon — so you can defend the village from the shadowy forces and rescue <strong>Lyra</strong>, your childhood friend who vanished during the assault.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat enemies to collect <strong>Azureo Crystal Fragments</strong>, which strengthen your sword and unlock unique combat spells.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a world filled with secrets, hidden areas, and challenging bosses. Use newly gained abilities to reach previously inaccessible places and prepare for a journey full of mystery and action.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Azureo Light</strong> is an action-adventure RPG. Wield the Cerulean Sword, face shadowy creatures, and uncover the secrets of a world on the brink of collapse.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A world in ruins, a dormant power, and a destiny waiting to be fulfilled.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Azureo Light</strong>, you play as <strong>Erian</strong>, the grandson of a master blacksmith and a resident of a peaceful village. When monsters suddenly appear and attack, your grandfather entrusts you with the legendary <strong>Cerulean Sword</strong> — a rare and powerful weapon — so you can defend the village from the shadowy forces and rescue <strong>Lyra</strong>, your childhood friend who vanished during the assault.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat enemies to collect <strong>Azureo Crystal Fragments</strong>, which strengthen your sword and unlock unique combat spells.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a world filled with secrets, hidden areas, and challenging bosses. Use newly gained abilities to reach previously inaccessible places and prepare for a journey full of mystery and action.</p>", "short_description": "Azureo Light is an action-adventure RPG. Wield the Cerulean Sword, face shadowy creatures, and uncover the secrets of a world on the brink of collapse.", "supported_languages": "English, Portuguese - Brazil", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4146860/79518b28e38944f5226ffd6837215efe41ed764f/header.jpg?t=1767382450", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4146860/7e8e78c938fdee9aa98101896cda789a30157f26/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767382450", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4146860/7e8e78c938fdee9aa98101896cda789a30157f26/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1767382450", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core 2 Quad Q9505<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Gtx 750 TI<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["Samuel Henriques"], "publishers": ["Samuel Henriques"], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": false}, "categories": [{"id": 2, "description": "Single-player"}, {"id": 57, "description": "DualSense Controller Support"}, {"id": 58, "descrip